  allLevels:
  - levelName: Level 1
    hintMessage: "H\xE3y k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p linh ho\u1EA1t gi\u1EEFa n\xFAt di chuy\u1EC3n tr\xE1i, ph\u1EA3i, nh\u1EA3y \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111o\u1EA1t \u0111c l\xE1 c\u1EDD v\xE0ng"
  - levelName: Level 2
    hintMessage: "\u0110\u01B0a chi\u1EBFc h\u1ED9p v\xE0o v\u1ECB tr\xED ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1EC3 leo l\xEAn b\u1EADc cao"
  - levelName: Level 3
    hintMessage: "B\u1EA1n h\xE3y t\u01B0\u01A1ng t\xE1c v\u1EDBi h\u1ED9p ! v\xE0 nh\u1EA5n v\xE0o d\xF2ng ch\u1EEF \"QUA M\xC0N\""
  - levelName: Level 4
    hintMessage: "H\xE3y k\xE9o m\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EA5t ngay d\u01B0\u1EDBi ch\xE2n th\xF4i"
  - levelName: Level 5
    hintMessage: "Th\u1EE9 gi\xFAp b\u1EA1n qua m\xE0n kh\xF4ng n\u1EB1m \u1EDF d\u01B0\u1EDBi \u0111\u1EA5t, m\xE0 n\u1EB1m ngay tr\xEAn ch\xEDnh nh\u1EEFng n\xFAt b\u1EA5m b\u1EA1n \u0111ang d\xF9ng. Th\u1EED ch\u1EA1m v\xE0 gi\u1EEF ch\xFAng xem sao?"
  - levelName: Level 6
    hintMessage: "\u0110\u1EADp v\xE0o th\xF9ng kia v\xE0 t\u1EA1o ra con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng v\xF4 h\xECnh"
  - levelName: Level 7
    hintMessage: "H\xE3y ph\xE1 h\u1EE7y h\u1ED9p v\xE0 b\u1EA5t ng\u1EDD s\u1EBD xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n, cho ph\xE9p kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng \u0111\u01B0a b\u1EA1n l\xEAn cao"
  - levelName: Level 8
    hintMessage: "B\u1EA1n h\xE3y gi\u1EEF nh\xE2n v\u1EADt v\xE0 di chuy\u1EC3n qua c\xE1c ch\u01B0\u1EDBng ngo\u1EA1i v\u1EADt."
  - levelName: Level 9
    hintMessage: "V\u1EABn c\xF3 n\xFAt c\xF3 kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng di chuy\u1EC3n m\xE0,h\xE3y th\u1EED l\u1EA1i xem sao"
  - levelName: Level 10
    hintMessage: "B\u1EA1n h\xE3y th\u1EED k\xE9o l\xEAn xu\u1ED1ng c\xE1c kh\u1ED1i \u0111\u1EA5t xem "
  - levelName: Level 11
    hintMessage: "H\xE3y d\xF9ng c\xE1ch \u0111\xE3 qua m\xE0n \u0111\u1EC3 th\u1EED xem"
  - levelName: Level 12
    hintMessage: "Khi b\u1EA1n nh\u1EA5n reset th\xEC s\u1EBD t\u1EA1o 1 m\u1ED9t nh\xE2n b\u1EA3n, b\u1EA1n h\xE3y d\xF9ng c\xE1c nh\xE2n b\u1EA3n n\xE0y nh\u01B0 1 c\xE2y c\u1EA7u."
  - levelName: Level 13
    hintMessage: "H\xE3y d\xF9ng n\xFAt \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o th\xE0nh 1 c\xE2y c\u1EA7u nh\u01B0 b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 l\xE0m tr\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\xF3"
  - levelName: Level 14
    hintMessage: "L\u1EA1i l\xE0 1 m\xE0n tu t\u1EEB th\xF4i, h\xE3y n\u1EAFm b\u1EAFt l\u1EA5y n\xF3"
  - levelName: Level 15
    hintMessage: "Th\u1EE9 gi\xFAp b\u1EA1n qua m\xE0n kh\xF4ng n\u1EB1m \u1EDF d\u01B0\u1EDBi \u0111\u1EA5t, m\xE0 n\u1EB1m ngay tr\xEAn ch\xEDnh nh\u1EEFng n\xFAt b\u1EA5m b\u1EA1n \u0111ang d\xF9ng. Th\u1EED ch\u1EA1m v\xE0 gi\u1EEF ch\xFAng xem sao?"
  - levelName: Level 16
    hintMessage: "Th\u1EE9 gi\xFAp b\u1EA1n qua m\xE0n kh\xF4ng n\u1EB1m \u1EDF d\u01B0\u1EDBi \u0111\u1EA5t, m\xE0 n\u1EB1m ngay tr\xEAn ch\xEDnh nh\u1EEFng n\xFAt b\u1EA5m b\u1EA1n \u0111ang d\xF9ng. Th\u1EED ch\u1EA1m v\xE0 gi\u1EEF ch\xFAng xem sao?"
  - levelName: Level 17
    hintMessage: "L\xE1 c\u1EDD th\u1EADt \u1EA9n d\u1EA5u xong t\u1EA5m b\u1EA3ng, h\xE3y vu\u1ED1t l\xEAn v\xE0 l\u1EA5y n\xF3"
  - levelName: Level 18
    hintMessage: "Kh\xF4ng ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 1 l\u1ED7i tho\xE1t m\xE0 c\xF2n l\xE0 2 l\u1ED1i tho\xE1t c\u01A1, c\xE1c UI c\xF3 kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng \u0111\xE3 th\u1EED r\u1ED3i th\xEC sao! "
  - levelName: Level 19
    hintMessage: "Th\u1EE9 gi\xFAp b\u1EA1n qua m\xE0n kh\xF4ng n\u1EB1m \u1EDF d\u01B0\u1EDBi \u0111\u1EA5t, m\xE0 n\u1EB1m ngay tr\xEAn ch\xEDnh nh\u1EEFng n\xFAt b\u1EA5m b\u1EA1n \u0111ang d\xF9ng. Th\u1EED ch\u1EA1m v\xE0 gi\u1EEF ch\xFAng xem sao?"
  - levelName: Level 20
    hintMessage: "Th\u1EE9 gi\xFAp b\u1EA1n qua m\xE0n kh\xF4ng n\u1EB1m \u1EDF d\u01B0\u1EDBi \u0111\u1EA5t, m\xE0 n\u1EB1m ngay tr\xEAn ch\xEDnh nh\u1EEFng n\xFAt b\u1EA5m b\u1EA1n \u0111ang d\xF9ng. Th\u1EED ch\u1EA1m v\xE0 gi\u1EEF ch\xFAng xem sao?"
  - levelName: Level 21
    hintMessage: "N\xFAt \u27F3 \u1EDF m\xE0n n\xE0y kh\xF4ng ch\u01A1i l\u1EA1i m\xE0 \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EA1i m\u1ED9t b\u1EA3n sao \u0111\u1EE9ng y\xEAn t\u1EA1i ch\u1ED7. B\u1EA3n sao c\u0169ng l\xE0 b\u1EADc thang!"
  - levelName: Level 22
    hintMessage: "M\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi gi\u1EEF c\u1EEDa, m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111i qua. \u0110\u1EE9ng tr\xEAn c\xF4ng t\u1EAFc r\u1ED3i b\u1EA5m \u27F3."
  - levelName: Level 23
    hintMessage: "Nh\u1EA3y l\xEAn ngay d\u01B0\u1EDBi m\xE9p tr\xE1i t\u1EA5m ch\xF4ng r\u1ED3i b\u1EA5m \u27F3: b\u1EA3n sao gi\u1EEFa kh\xF4ng trung s\u1EBD th\xE0nh c\u1ED9t ch\u1ED1ng tr\u1EA7n."
  - levelName: Level 24
    hintMessage: "C\u1EA7n hai b\u1EA3n sao: m\u1ED9t b\u1EA3n \u0111\u1EE9ng gi\u1EEF c\xF4ng t\u1EAFc, m\u1ED9t b\u1EA3n l\xE0m b\u1EADc thang \u1EDF ch\xE2n th\xE1p."
  - levelName: Level 25
    hintMessage: "Ch\u1EA1m v\xE0o c\xE2y c\u1EA7u r\u1ED3i k\xE9o l\xEAn/xu\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1EC3 n\xF3 n\u1EB1m ngang."
  - levelName: Level 26
    hintMessage: "Kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE1 c\u1EDD n\xE0o c\u0169ng th\u1EADt, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i m\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EA5t n\xE0o c\u0169ng \u0111\u1EE9ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c. Th\u1EED quay l\u1EA1i ph\xEDa sau xem."
  - levelName: Level 27
    hintMessage: "\u0110\xE1m m\xE2y k\xE9o \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c. \u0110\u1EB7t n\xF3 d\u01B0\u1EDBi m\xE9p tr\xE1i t\u1EA5m ch\xF4ng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi \u0111i qua."
  - levelName: Level 28
    hintMessage: "\u0110\u1EA9y h\u1ED9p l\xEAn c\xF4ng t\u1EAFc \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1EDF c\u1EEDa, r\u1ED3i k\xE9o c\u1EA7u n\u1EB1m ngang."
